  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### Why am I not able to add the previous accounting period?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 15 Aug, 2024 at 12:15 PM\n\nThis error happens due to the accounting period being earlier than the business start date. \n\nPlease see video below:\n\nNavigation: My Admin > Clients > Select Client > Edit Client > Business Start Date \n\nTo add a previous accounting period change the business start date under my admin panel.\n\nOnce this detail is updated you can add update the accounting period.  \n\nCongratulations! You've have successfully updated the business start date. If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.\n\nClick here to watch how to delete an accounting period\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188543\">Accounts Production FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Why am I not able to add the previous accounting period?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 15 Aug, 2024 at 12:15 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This error happens due to the accounting period being earlier than the business start date.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please see video below:<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9148184049/original/OrBd8K_290M2NN_-kUOQBvA-e6rc_71gnw.gif?1640871527\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9148184049\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: My Admin &gt; Clients &gt; Select Client &gt; Edit Client &gt; Business Start Date&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To add a previous accounting period change the business start date under my admin panel.</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once this detail is updated you can add update the accounting period. &nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216719223/original/sr3XxJbO1Lc3cF6AYpw9okLiAitmsEO8NQ.png?1723720404\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216719223\"><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Congratulations! You've have successfully updated the business start date. If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.</strong></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><div rel=\"clipboard_data\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/a7dc6bee50b7453c81643cb91e6aa2d9\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to delete an accounting period</span></strong></a></div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165555\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165555/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165555\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165555/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" 